{
 "id": 587235164378,
 "title": "29er MTB Build by Simon",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"680938726\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c380\">What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">It was something a friend and myself were discussing a couple of years or so ago, eventually myself deciding to home build a 29er - as I already have a 650b+ a single speed 26er and a 1993 orange clockwork!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"845063547\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<p class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">i really enjoyed the build, i would say take your time getting all the bamboo to fit prperly together with the other sections of bamboo and the headstock and boottom bracket shell.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"805044919\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c385\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">The hardest part i found (as it took me several attempts) was the routing of the right hand chainstay between the wheel and chainset</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"1370153519\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\">\n<br>What was the easiest part of the build?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">iironically the easiet part was applying the resin and flax!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"862135650\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c390\"></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c390\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">unfortunatly due to my job, ive not had a real opportunity to ride it!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"1476906189\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c393\"></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c393\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?\u00a0</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">If there is a next time, i'd route the internal cable of the rear brake a little better around the bottom bracket.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
 "blog_id": 73142304951,
